      "content": "i get what you're saying about stress, but it's not just a feeling. i've actually seen the screen go black right as i lose my temper. it's too consistent to just be coincidence. it feels like my internal energy is just too much for the equipment around me to handle. like, how would one even go about learning to stabilize that? kind of like managing an aura or something so it doesn't leak out and cause a scene?",
